 "note": "S, 11 platforms, FFA 5, king of the hill, outward. Five homes and five pockets zigzag round a hill (T4) in the middle: every pocket sits between two homes, reaches both and holds a long bridge into the hill. No relays: a five-fold map has no relay spot that is fair to all five seats in both relay states. The hill falls first at the Last Stand; the ring of homes and pockets fights on. Five-fold symmetric. Waivers (Daniele 2026-09-29, Decisions page): L07 - the surviving homes are the finale's production; L05 - no relay works in the finale (the 83 m height leaves no room for one on the ring).",
